Streaming for the x gem, built on the HTTP client in x-core.
- X::StreamingClient reads the sample and filtered streams of the X API, a post
  at a time, and reconnects a stream that drops, backing off as X recommends.
- It reads, adds, and deletes the rules of the filtered stream, each an
  X::StreamRule.

Its only dependency is x-core. Installing x installs this gem too, and require
"x" gives every X::Client its streaming method.
